(text "12 V IN. Barrel jack, PTC fuse, reverse-polarity Schottky, then an R-78E switching regulator makes the\n5 V rail for everything, Nano included (its 5V pin; VIN open). A PC on the Nano's USB with no adapter plugged\nin runs the logic with the tubes dark - the boost has no 12 V."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 43.18 0)
